sight primitives are:\n- Summary band \"Top agent\" → `TopAgent` (needed)\n- Summary band \"Top model\" → `TopModel` (needed)\n- Session list action tag → `NextAction` + `ActionHint` (needed)\n\nEverything else I wrote is speculative:\n- `TopSkill` — stub, since `RecapCheckpoint` doesn't even carry `SkillsUsed` yet\n- `EmergingSkills`, `LongestStreak`, `MostActiveDay`, `WeekOverWeekDelta` — no concrete panel in the mockup depends on these\n- `IdleWithUncommitted` — appears in mockup as inline callout; could be inline in render, doesn't need a function\n\n## Proposed cut\n\nSlim `insights.go` to ~80 lines containing only:\n- `TopAgent(sessions) (string, int)`\n- `TopModel(sessions) (string, int)`\n- `ActionHint` type + constants\n- `NextAction(s RecapSession) ActionHint`\n\nDelete the rest. If wireframing later requires \"most active day\" or \"streak\", we add them then — they're ~15 lines each and trivially testable.\n\n## What to do about the just-written code\n\nIt's uncommitted. Three options:\n\n- **A.** I edit `insights.go` down to the 4 keep-items right now, write tests only for those, commit Chunk 2.\n- **B.** I keep everything, add tests for everything, commit — accepting some code is speculative.\n- **C.** You want an even more aggressive cut (e.g., merge `TopAgent/TopModel` into `aggregate.go` and drop `insights.go` entirely).\n\nI'd go with **A**. Want me to do that?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":61,"cache_read_input_tokens":393317,"output_tokens":4604,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":61},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":4604,"cache_read_input_tokens":393317,"cache_creation_input_tokens":61,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":61,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed