{"parentUuid":"9682994d-9abe-4a23-b5c2-041a4241067e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_012K4aJz14JwKukAYTriRHJo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Got it — the Agents view is a different layout (per-agent cards) that should be the default. My \"flag-only\" collapse was wrong; we kept Agents as a distinct view early in the conversation and I lost it.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- Two orthogonal dimensions: **layout** (Agents-cards vs Sessions-chronological) and **range** (day/week/month/30d/90d). Flags set the range and filters. Layout is a separate axis.\n- `entire recap --agent X` is a filter applied to whatever layout is active — it narrows data, it doesn't switch layout. That matches your phrasing: *\"just only show everything with claude-code only.\"*\n- Making Agents the default view changes the first-impression answer from \"here's what you did chronologically\" to \"here's how your agents stack up\" — which is a better overview for a multi-agent CLI.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\n## Concrete proposal\n\n**Default layout (Agents view):** per-agent cards, one card per agent present in range. Each card shows:\n- agent name + session count + token total\n- top-3 labels as mini-bars\n- top-3 skills\n- top-3 MCP servers\n- sparkline / intensity indicator\n\nPlus the same summary band + activity strip on top, same Repos/Worktrees/Labels bottom panel. Only the middle \"what happened\" panel swaps between Agents-cards and Sessions-list.\n\n**Layout switching:**\n- `entire recap` → Agents view (default)\n- In TUI: press `s` for Sessions view, `a` for Agents view (or a single `tab` key to toggle)\n- Static / piped mode shows the Agents view unless you pass an explicit `--view sessions` flag (keeps flag surface small)\n\n**Flags unchanged:**\n```\nentire recap                           # Agents view, today, all agents\nentire recap --week                    # Agents view, last 7 days, all agents\nentire recap --30 --agent claude-code  # Agents view, 30 days, just claude-code\nentire recap --week | head             # piped → static Agents output\n```\n\n**When `--agent X` is active in Agents view:** the view collapses to a single big card for that agent with drill-down detail inline. Makes the filter feel obviously coherent with the layout.\n\n## What this takes\n\nOne commit:\n- Add `AgentsView` panel renderer (composes existing `AggregateByAgent` output into cards using Chunk 3 primitives)\n- Wire it into `View` as the default middle-panel choice\n- TUI key handler: `s` / `a` to toggle between views\n- Tests for rendering + toggle\n\nWant me to build this? Confirm and I'll do it as one Chunk 5b commit."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1931,"cache_read_input_tokens":526915,"output_tokens":4791,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1931},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":4791,"cache_read_input_tokens":526915,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1931,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1931,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaHrkBbxh82RXq4ZQuspb","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e06d6dd-39f4-4f74-9f6d-e82f74f8589a","timestamp":"2026-04-22T00:26:03.652Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"b35707d3-641d-4b8a-83b2-52ef9ab92ecf","version":"2.1.116","gitBranch":"entire-activity"}
