{"parentUuid":"81661a54-d34d-486e-ab6a-72b3f542c977","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01K64A3M9oASrCoYAtwe6vX3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes — all five fields are available for **both** sides. Same analysis storage, just queried by different sets of checkpoint IDs.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n- **Me side**: `db.checkpoints.getByUser(userId, window)` → filter to repo → `db.analyses.getByCheckpointIds(repoId, ids)`. The returned `StoredCheckpointAnalysis` carries all five deterministic fields per checkpoint.\n- **Contributor side**: `db.checkpoints.getForBranch(repoId, branch, window)` → `db.analyses.getByCheckpointIds(repoId, ids)`. Same shape, wider set.\n- Each analysis is attributed to its producing agent (from checkpoint metadata), so the aggregation — skills union, MCP count-sum, toolProfile category-sum, transcript-token sum, files-changed sum — all works identically on both sides.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\n## Two tiny updates to the draft\n\nMy `recap-aggregator.ts` currently tracks labels + skills + mcp + toolMix but skips transcript tokens and files changed. Extending it to sum those two fields per agent."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2130,"cache_read_input_tokens":914011,"output_tokens":3369,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2130,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":3369,"cache_read_input_tokens":914011,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2130,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2130},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaKgb2fnU27GBmxCD2dzg","type":"assistant","uuid":"f0650d98-d5aa-48e8-bab9-c191ad73d76d","time