                │\n│ Codex         fileOps 38m · shell 14m · conversation 24m                     │\n│               search 4m · agent 0 · mcp 0                                    │\n│               of which committing: 2m (3 commits)                            │\n╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n╭─ Typical Modes By Agent «99» ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ Claude Code   ● feature_build  ● bug_fix                                     │\n│ Codex         ● investigation  ● refactor                                    │\n│ Cursor        ● feature_build  ● documentation                               │\n╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n```\n\n### Repos tab\n\n```text\n╭─ Repos · last 30d · repo: all ────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ Repos  4   Sessions  51   Checkpoints  143   Linked  27                      │\n╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n╭─ Repo Cards «214» ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ entireio/cli       21 sessions   66 checkpoints   linked rate 62%            │\n│ entireio/api       14 sessions   38 checkpoints   linked rate 57%            │\n│ entireio/web       11 sessions   29 checkpoints   linked rate 45%            │\n│ sandbox/project     5 sessions   10 checkpoints   linked rate 20%            │\n╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n```\n\n### History tab\n\n```text\n╭─ History · 90d · profile: observability ──────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ Sessions  61   Checkpoints  184   Linked Rate  58%   Agents  3               │\n╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n╭─ Heatmap «43 green» ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ Jan                                                                      Mar │\n│  · ░ ▒ █ · · ░ ░ █ ▒ · · ░ █ █ ▒ · · ░ ░ ▒ █ · · ░ ▒ █ ▒ ░ ·                 │\n╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n╭─ Trends «99» ──────────────────╮  ╭─ Agent Mix Over Time «170» ───────────╮\n│ Sessions / week                │  │ Claude Code      ████████            │\n│ Checkpoints / week             │  │ Codex            ████                │\n│ Linked commits / week          │  │ Cursor           ██                  │\n╰─────────────────────────────────╯  ╰────────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n╭─ Outliers «214» ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│ Highest checkpoint density   2026-03-27   9 checkpoints in 42m              │\n│ Longest span                 2026-04-03   2h 14m                            │\n│ Most delegated session       2026-04-08   5 task checkpoints                │\n╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n```\n\n### Report tab\n\nProduces a shareable markdown/text report from the current range. Templates in v1:\n\n- `daily` — standup-format: \"Yesterday / Today / Notable checkpoints / Followups\"\n- `weekly` — week summary aggregating top sessions + labels\n\nNice-to-have, not primary. Driven by `entire activity report --template <name> --format markdown|text`.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n`ACCESSIBLE=1` mode is a separate renderer, not a reformatted TUI.\n\nRules:\n\n- No box-drawing characters (`╭─╮│`).\n- No heatmap grid — degrades to a per-day numeric table.\n- No gradient bars — degrades to proportional bar using `=` characters with a numeric value.\n- Sections use plain `H2`-style capitalized headers with a blank line.\n- Nested data uses two-space indentation, not columns.\n- Tab bar → linear H2 section per view.\n- Drill-down → indented section under the selected session.\n- Actions footer → list of real `entire ...` commands, copy-pasteable.\n\nExample (today tab):\n\n```text\nEntire Activity — today\nRepo: current · Profile: personal\n\nSummary\n  Sessions: 3\n  Checkpoints: 11\n  Linked Commits: 2\n  Span: 2h 47m\n  Focus Areas: 3\n\nModes\n  feature_build: 2\n  bug_fix: 1\n  testing: 0\n\nFocus Areas\n  checkpoint storage: 6 checkpoints\n  session state: 3 checkpoints\n  hooks: 2 checkpoints\n\nRecent Sessions\n  1. 09:12-10:06 — bug_fix — checkpoint storage, session state — linked commit\n  2. 11:20-12:01 — feature_build — hooks, strategy — active\n  3. 14:31-14:52 — testing — agent integrations — delegated\n\nTo drill into a session:\n  entire activity today --session <session-id>\n  entire explain --session <session-id>\n```\n\nDetection: `os.Getenv(\"ACCESSIBLE\") != \"\"` or non-tty writer or `NO_COLOR` + narrow terminal.\n\n## Package Layout\n\nSlimmer than originally proposed. Classifier is out; file list is ~10-12.\n\nAdd `cmd/entire/cli/activity/`:\n\n- `model.go` — `ActivitySession`, `ActivityCheckpoint`, `ActivityDay`, summary types\n- `load.go` — local loaders using `strategy.ListSessionStates` / `ListCheckpoints`\n- `load_linked.go` — `Entire-Checkpoint` trailer lookup\n- `enrich.go` — api enrichment (labels, toolProfile) with cache\n- `focus_areas.go` — rule engine + built-ins + `.entire/activity_areas.json` loader\n- `metrics.go` — aggregators (per-day, per-range, per-repo, per-agent)\n- `heatmap.go` — heatmap cell binning\n- `tool_time.go` — local transcript walker for active sessions\n- `styles.go` — lipgloss styles, palette, label colors, gradient bar, heatmap ramp\n- `tui_model.go` — bubbletea model, tab state\n- `tui_panels.go` — panel renderers (KPI, modes, focus, heatmap, etc.)\n- `tui_keys.go` — keyboard handling\n- `static.go` — static renderer for non-tty / piped\n- `json.go` — JSON output with `schema_version: \"v1\"`\n- `report.go` — daily/weekly markdown templates\n\nCLI entrypoints (thin wrappers over the package):\n\n- `cmd/entire/cli/activity.go` — root + today (default)\n- `cmd/entire/cli/activity_range.go`\n- `cmd/entire/cli/activity_history.go`\n- `cmd/entire/cli/activity_agents.go`\n- `cmd/entire/cli/activity_repos.go`\n- `cmd/entire/cli/activity_report.go`\n\nSmall shared refactor:\n\n- Extract `timeAgo` from `status.go` into `stringutil/time.go` so `activity` + `status` + `sessions` all share it.\n\n## JSON Output\n\nEvery `--json` response:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"v1\",\n  \"generated_at\": \"2026-04-16T14:23:11Z\",\n  \"scope\": { \"repo\": \"entireio/cli\", \"from\": \"2026-04-09\", \"to\": \"2026-04-16\" },\n  \"sessions\": [ ... ],\n  \"aggregates\": { ... }\n}\n```\n\nSchema versioning makes the output a stable contract. Downstream tools gate on `schema_version` before parsing.\n\n## Validation Plan\n\n### Data projection\n\n- Unit tests for `load.go` using in-memory fake session states and committed metadata. Assert the resulting `ActivitySession` fields match expectations.\n- Table-driven tests for focus-area rule matching: priority, longest-match, fallback.\n- Tests for `Entire-Checkpoint` trailer lookup against fixture git repos (use `testutil.InitRepo`).\n\n### Metrics\n\n- Session-span derivation across edge cases: single checkpoint, identical timestamps, missing timestamps.\n- Heatmap bucketing across timezones.\n- Streak calculation on sparse date sets (matches FE `useUserDashboardData.ts` behavior).\n- Linked-commit rate with and without trailers.\n\n### Api enrichment\n\n- Mock `api.Client` returning `StoredCheckpointAnalysis` stubs.\n- Cache hit / miss paths.\n- Offline fallback: ensure no api calls when no token present.\n- Pipeline version invalidation.\n\n### TUI\n\n- Snapshot tests for each tab's panel rendering at 80, 100, 160 cols.\n- View switching, drill-down state, `ACCESSIBLE=1` fallback path.\n\n### Golden output\n\n- `--json` golden files per tab, frozen clock.\n- Static renderer golden files per tab with `NO_COLOR=1`.\n\n## Risks\n\n- `--repo all` requires api access; offline users get single-repo only. Documented in `labels: offline · tip: ...` footer.\n- Tool-time measurements include agent thinking (not pure exec time). Label explicitly as \"Time between tool calls.\"\n- Commit-link lookup across long ranges can be slow. Mitigated by caching and lazy enrichment.\n- Weak focus-area rules produce noisy summaries. Mitigated by repo-local `.entire/activity_areas.json` override.\n- Dashboard density at 80 cols — narrow-mode stacked layout handles this.\n\n## Decisions (Locked)\n\n- Tabbed dashboard-first UI with 6 tabs.\n- Local-first data model with lazy api enrichment; three-tier truth table.\n- Sessions as containers, checkpoints as evidence; activity types are projections, never persisted.\n- Repo is a first-class dimension; `--repo all` is default for logged-in users.\n- No sprint framing, no file-churn leaderboard, no LLM prose in CLI.\n- Server-authoritative labels via `StoredCheckpointAnalysis` (18-label multi-label taxonomy); no local classifier.\n- Honest session span time via first-to-last checkpoint timestamp.\n- Tool-time breakdown with 8 categories (6 tool + conversation + commit).\n- Drill-down surfaces real `entire ...` commands as an Actions footer.\n- `--json` includes `schema_version: \"v1\"` from day one.\n- Visual language inherits lipgloss palette, extends with semantic label colors and per-panel borders.\n- No emoji — Unicode geometry only.\n- Upstream server changes (durationMs, session_span_ms) are optional enrichment, not v1 blockers.\n","numLines":848,"startLine":1,"totalLines":848}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"90e5a1d2-6a68-4722-a211-daae20317137","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"b35707d3-641d-4b8a-83b2-52ef9ab92ecf","version":"2.1.116","gitBranch":"entire-activity","slug":"kind-beaming-shannon"}
