code>, <code>Focus (mixed)</code>, <code>0 tokens · 0 commits</code> in totals — these placeholders show up constantly because the upstream data isn't always there. The redesign removes them.</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#eee;\">Summary panel</h3>\n\n<div class=\"split\">\n  <div class=\"mockup\">\n    <div class=\"mockup-header\">Before</div>\n    <div class=\"mockup-body\"><pre>\n<span class=\"label\">╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────╮</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">Last 90 days</span>                                   <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                  <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">Top agent</span>  <span class=\"value\">Codex</span>  <span class=\"label\">Top skill</span>  <span class=\"muted\">—</span>            <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">Focus</span>      <span class=\"muted\">(mixed)</span>  <span class=\"label\">Top model</span>  <span class=\"value\">gpt-5.4</span>     <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                  <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">Totals</span>  <span class=\"value\">40 sessions · 92 checkpoints ·</span>       <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>          <span class=\"value\">0 tokens · 0 commits</span>                  <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span></pre></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mockup\">\n    <div class=\"mockup-header\">After</div>\n    <div class=\"mockup-body\"><pre>\n<span class=\"label\">╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────╮</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"amber\">Last 90 days</span>                                   <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                  <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"you-label\">you</span>   <span class=\"value\">40 sessions</span>  <span class=\"value\">92 checkpoints</span>  <span class=\"value\">3.5M tok</span>   <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"team-label\">team</span>  <span class=\"value\">5 sessions</span>   <span class=\"value\">6 checkpoints</span>   <span class=\"value\">17k tok</span>    <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                  <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">5 agents · 1 repo · 14 active days</span>              <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span></pre></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#eee;\">What dropped, what stayed</h3>\n<ul style=\"color:#ccc;\">\n  <li><strike>Top agent</strike> — already the dominant card in the agents panel; redundant up top.</li>\n  <li><strike>Top skill</strike> — usually empty (local skill extraction isn't in scope); placeholder churn.</li>\n  <li><strike>Focus</strike> — \"(mixed)\" 90% of the time; if it's meaningful, it belongs as a label filter.</li>\n  <li><strike>Top model</strike> — trivia, not actionable; already surfaces in agent card.</li>\n  <li><strong>Kept: 3-metric roll-up (sessions, checkpoints, tokens) split by you / team.</strong> Matches the Agents panel's framing so the eye travels naturally down.</li>\n  <li><strong>Kept: context line</strong> — agent count, repo count, active days. These help calibrate what you're looking at.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#eee; margin-top: 28px;\">Activity strip</h3>\n\n<div class=\"split\">\n  <div class=\"mockup\">\n    <div class=\"mockup-header\">Before — 90d</div>\n    <div class=\"mockup-body\"><