up\">\n  <div class=\"mockup-header\">When all 4 top signals have data</div>\n  <div class=\"mockup-body\"><pre>\n<span class=\"label\">╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"amber\">Last 90 days</span>                                                         <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"you-label\">you</span>   <span class=\"value\">40 sessions</span>   <span class=\"value\">92 checkpoints</span>   <span class=\"value\">3.5M tok</span>                   <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"team-label\">team</span>  <span class=\"value\">5 sessions</span>    <span class=\"value\">6 checkpoints</span>    <span class=\"value\">17k tok</span>                    <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">top</span>  <span class=\"amber\">Codex</span> · <span class=\"cyan\">code-simplifier</span> · <span class=\"red\">bug_fix</span> · <span class=\"value\">claude-opus-4-7[1m]</span>       <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">5 agents · 1 repo · 14 active days</span>                                     <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span></pre></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mockup\">\n  <div class=\"mockup-header\">When only some top signals have data (typical case)</div>\n  <div class=\"mockup-body\"><pre>\n<span class=\"label\">╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"amber\">Last 90 days</span>                                                         <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"you-label\">you</span>   <span class=\"value\">40 sessions</span>   <span class=\"value\">92 checkpoints</span>   <span class=\"value\">3.5M tok</span>                   <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"team-label\">team</span>  <span class=\"value\">0 sessions</span>    <span class=\"value\">0 checkpoints</span>    <span class=\"value\">0 tok</span>                      <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">top</span>  <span class=\"amber\">Codex</span> · <span class=\"value\">gpt-5.4</span>                                               <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">2 agents · 1 repo · 6 active days</span>                                      <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span></pre></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mockup\">\n  <div class=\"mockup-header\">When no top signals at all (fresh repo)</div>\n  <div class=\"mockup-body\"><pre>\n<span class=\"label\">╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"amber\">Last 90 days</span>                                                         <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"you-label\">you</span>   <span class=\"value\">2 sessions</span>    <span class=\"value\">3 checkpoints</span>    <span class=\"value\">12k tok</span>                    <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"team-label\">team</span>  <span class=\"value\">0 sessions</span>    <span class=\"value\">0 checkpoints</span>    <span class=\"value\">0 tok</span>                      <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>                                                                        <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">│</span>  <span class=\"label\">1 agent · 1 repo · 2 active days</span>                                       <span class=\"label\">│</span>\n<span class=\"label\">╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span></pre></div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#eee; margin-top: 24px;\">Rules</h3>\n<ul style=\"color:#ccc;\">\n  <li><strong>\"top\" line</strong> — single horizontal line prefixed with <code>top</code>, content is 4 signals in fixed order: agent → skill → label → model. Separator is <code>·</code>.</li>\n  <li><strong>Empty signals disappear, the line reflows.</strong> If top skill is empty, it just skips from agent to label.</li>\n  <li><strong>All four empty → the \"top\" line doesn't render.</strong> Card shrinks by one row.</li>\n  <li><strong>Label <code>Focus</code> drops, replaced by <code>top label</code></strong> (using the same data — the dominant label). <code>\"(mixed)\"</code> was the sentinel; now it just omits.</li>\n  <li><strong>you/team metrics stay as shown</strong>, even when one side is 0 (the 0 row is still informative — it tells you no team activity at all, vs 