mparison bars, and a view toggle (you / team / both). The spec is the output of a brainstorming session.\n\n## Output Format\n\n## Spec Review\n\n**Status:** ✅ Approved | ❌ Issues Found\n\n**Issues (if any):**\n- [Section X]: [specific issue] - [why it matters]\n\n**Recommendations (advisory):**\n- [suggestions that don't block approval]\n\nBe thorough but fair. Flag real gaps, don't nitpick prose. Under 500 words in the response."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":318980,"output_tokens":897,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":897,"cache_read_input_tokens":318980,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaL4LfcBUMzThiVwnRGaP","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d8c4b94-13a0-44ca-98c5-01d081b05ce2","timestamp":"2026-04-23T04:18:21.722Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"b35707d3-641d-4b8a-83b2-52ef9ab92ecf","version":"2.1.116","gitBranch":"entire-activity","slug":"kind-beaming-shannon"}
