pGlyphRune(v, maxV))\n    }\n    return b.String()\n}\n\n// formatPeak returns \"most active: <time>\" where <time> is hour for --day\n// and date for all other ranges. Returns \"\" when all activity is zero.\n// Ties pick the rightmost (most recent) bucket.\nfunc formatPeak(view View) string {\n    peakIdx := -1\n    peakV := 0\n    for i, v := range view.Activity {\n        if v >= peakV && v > 0 {\n            peakIdx = i\n            peakV = v\n        }\n    }\n    if peakIdx < 0 {\n        return \"\"\n    }\n    if view.Range == RangeDay {\n        return fmt.Sprintf(\"most active: %02d:00\", peakIdx)\n    }\n    start := time.Now().AddDate(0, 0, -(len(view.Activity) - 1))\n    d := start.AddDate(0, 0, peakIdx)\n    return \"most active: \" + d.Format(\"Jan 2\")\n}\n\nfunc rangeTag(r RangeKey) string {\n    switch r {\n    case RangeDay:\n        return \"24h\"\n    case RangeWeek:\n        return \"7d\"\n    case RangeMonth:\n        return \"this month\"\n    case Range90d:\n        return \"90d\"\n    }\n    return \"\"\n}\n```\n\n- [ ] **Step 5: Run — expect green**\n\n```bash\ngo test ./cmd/entire/cli/recap/ -run TestRenderActivityStrip -count=1 -v\nmise run test 2>&1 | tail -10\n```\n\n- [ ] **Step 6: Commit**\n\n```bash\nmise run fmt && mise run lint && mise run test\ngit add cmd/entire/cli/recap/render_static.go cmd/entire/cli/recap/render_static_test.go\ngit commit -m \"feat(recap): pad activity strip + add peak annotation\n\nSpec: docs/2026-04-22-entire-recap-visual-redesign-design.md §Activity.\nRenders every cell (including zero days) and anchors rightmost to today.\nHourly 'most active' format for --day; 'Jan 2' for longer ranges.\n\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Chunk 5: Agents card rewrite\n\nThe largest chunk. Rewrites the per-agent card around three field groups and view toggle.\n\n### Task 7: Rewrite agents card\n\n**Files:**\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/recap/agents_card.go`\n- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/recap/agents_card_test.go`\n\n- [ ] **Step 1: Write 