ities or likely to grow unwieldy\n- Tests that don't actually cover the spec's 9 renderComparisonBar cases\n- Places where the plan hand-waves (\"adjust imports\", \"update related tests\")\n\n## Output Format\n\n## Plan Review\n\n**Status:** ✅ Approved | ❌ Issues Found\n\n**Issues (if any):**\n- [Chunk X, Task Y, Step Z]: [specific issue] - [why it matters]\n\n**Recommendations (advisory):**\n- [suggestions that don't block approval]\n\nBe thorough but fair. Under 600 words."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1198,"cache_read_input_tokens":369629,"output_tokens":922,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1198,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":922,"cache_read_input_tokens":369629,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1198},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaL6BbdoLUCXZZZzmFmDp","type":"assistant","uuid":"e59be116-f790-4309-9d16-9aa7153a49df","timestamp":"2026-04-23T04:42:32.574Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-activity","sessionId":"b35707d3-641d-4b8a-83b2-52ef9ab92ecf","version":"2.1.116","gitBranch":"entire-activity","slug":"kind-beaming-shannon"}
